     "en": "All of us feel happy at different times and for different reasons. When do you feel happy? Write your answers.\nWe feel happy when we eat our favourite foods, made from grains, pulses and vegetables.\nMatch food items with their ingredients.\nFollow the journey of a rice or wheat grain from the farm to our plate: it is grown, harvested, cleaned, sold, cooked and eaten.\nFarmers, sellers and animals help, and water, soil and sunlight are also needed.\nHealthy habits like hygiene, exercise and sleep keep us feeling good."
